function sleepOptions(selected){return [['never','永不休眠'],[30,'空闲 30 分钟'],[60,'空闲 1 小时'],[120,'空闲 2 小时'],[240,'空闲 4 小时'],[480,'空闲 8 小时']].map(([v,l])=>`<option value="${v}" ${String(selected??'never')===String(v)?'selected':''}>${l}</option>`).join('')}
async function openSpace(id){if(!overview.tenants.length)await loadOverview();selectedSpace=adminInstances.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!selectedSpace)return;const deleting=selectedSpace.status==='deleting';$('#space-settings-form').classList.toggle('hidden',deleting);$('#space-dialog .member-manager').classList.toggle('hidden',deleting);$('#space-dialog .space-model-section').classList.toggle('hidden',deleting);$('#space-delete').disabled=['starting','provisioning','stopping'].includes(selectedSpace.status);$('#space-delete').textContent=deleting?'重试删除':'删除空间';$('#space-dialog-name').textContent=selectedSpace.name;if(deleting){$('#space-dialog').showModal();return}const f=$('#space-settings-form');f.elements.name.value=selectedSpace.name;f.elements.idleTimeoutMinutes.innerHTML=sleepOptions(selectedSpace.idleTimeoutMinutes);$('#space-dialog-name').textContent=selectedSpace.name;$('#space-settings-message').textContent='';clearTimeout(memberUserTimer);memberUserPage=1;$('#member-user-search').value='';$('#space-dialog').showModal();await Promise.all([loadMemberCandidates(),loadMembers()]);}
let memberUserPage=1,memberUserSequence=0,memberUserTimer;
async function loadMemberCandidates(){
  const spaceId=selectedSpace?.id,sequence=++memberUserSequence,select=$('#space-member-form select[name=userId]');
  select.disabled=true;select.innerHTML='<option value="">正在查询…</option>';
  $('#member-user-prev').disabled=true;$('#member-user-next').disabled=true;
  $('#space-member-form button[type=submit]').disabled=true;$('#member-user-message').textContent='';
  try{
    const params=new URLSearchParams({page:String(memberUserPage),pageSize:'20',q:$('#member-user-search').value.trim()});
    const r=await request(`/api/admin/instances/${spaceId}/member-candidates?${params}`);
    if(sequence!==memberUserSequence||selectedSpace?.id!==spaceId)return;
    memberUserPage=r.page;
    select.innerHTML='<option value="">请选择用户</option>'+r.users.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x.id)}">${esc(x.displayName)}（${esc(x.username)}）</option>`).join('');
    select.disabled=!r.users.length;select.onchange?.();
    $('#space-member-form button[type=submit]').disabled=!r.users.length;
    $('#member-user-page').textContent=`共 ${r.total} 位用户 · 第 ${r.page} / ${Math.max(1,Math.ceil(r.total/20))} 页 · 每页 20 位`;
    $('#member-user-prev').disabled=r.page<=1;$('#member-user-next').disabled=r.page*20>=r.total;
    if(!r.users.length)$('#member-user-message').textContent='没有符合条件的同租户启用用户。';
  }catch(error){if(sequence!==memberUserSequence||selectedSpace?.id!==spaceId)return;select.innerHTML='<option value="">查询失败</option>';$('#member-user-message').textContent=error.message;$('#member-user-page').textContent='';}
}
$('#member-user-search').oninput=()=>{clearTimeout(memberUserTimer);++memberUserSequence;$('#member-user-prev').disabled=true;$('#member-user-next').disabled=true;$('#space-member-form select[name=userId]').disabled=true;$('#space-member-form button[type=submit]').disabled=true;memberUserTimer=setTimeout(()=>{memberUserPage=1;void loadMemberCandidates()},300)};
$('#member-user-prev').onclick=()=>{memberUserPage--;void loadMemberCandidates()};
$('#member-user-next').onclick=()=>{memberUserPage++;void loadMemberCandidates()};
async function loadMembers(){spaceMembers=(await request(`/api/admin/instances/${selectedSpace.id}/members`)).members;$('#space-member-list').innerHTML=spaceMembers.length?spaceMembers.map(x=>`<div class="member-row"><span><strong>${esc(x.displayName)}</strong><small>${esc(x.username)}</small></span><span class="pill">${accessName[x.accessRole]}</span>${x.accessRole==='owner'?'<span></span>':`<button class="remove-member" data-id="${x.id}">移除</button>`}</div>`).join(''):'<div class="empty compact">尚未绑定成员。</div>';$$('#space-member-list .remove-member').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{if(await confirmAction('移除空间成员？','该用户将立即失去此空间的访问权限。','移除',true)){await request(`/api/admin/instances/${selectedSpace.id}/members/${b.dataset.id}`,{method:'DELETE'});await Promise.all([loadMembers(),loadAdminInstances()]);toast('成员已移除')}});const s=$('#space-member-form select[name=userId]'),sync=()=>{$('#space-member-form select[name=accessRole]').value=spaceMembers.find(x=>x.id===s.value)?.accessRole||'member'};s.onchange=sync;sync()}
